{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FLY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an agile fly\u2011by\u2011wire spaceship in this <strong>single-player, first-person spaceflight simulator</strong>. Use the engine boost to fly at the limit, or save energy for the next wormhole jump. Collisions are costly; the polarized hull will protect the ship, but it will corrupt the memory core. <strong>You may lose your hard\u2011earned research data</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/924c82a24d8f66f1f1060cb21f08cb26.poster.avif?t=1759751628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/924c82a24d8f66f1f1060cb21f08cb26.webm?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/924c82a24d8f66f1f1060cb21f08cb26.mp4?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the ship scanner to detect anomalies. Fly in, <strong>run an analysis</strong>, and fill the memory core. Then, retrieve the data and leave before hull polarization becomes an issue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/ccf1b71a01e33ead072aac7b401d19d2.poster.avif?t=1759751628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/ccf1b71a01e33ead072aac7b401d19d2.webm?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/ccf1b71a01e33ead072aac7b401d19d2.mp4?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Labs and observatories run science projects that require specific data. Selling the right sets pays more than generic sales. <strong>Decide which to sell</strong> now and which to hold. Completing projects helps stations to reach the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/b3c4ddd767a3f2a00c22bbc1b8d8ffd5.poster.avif?t=1759751628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/b3c4ddd767a3f2a00c22bbc1b8d8ffd5.webm?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/b3c4ddd767a3f2a00c22bbc1b8d8ffd5.mp4?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENJOY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space exploration can be hard work. Sometimes it's a good idea to zoom out, and look at things from a different angle. Space can be quite relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/d0f96a0b9a00c16652515a693ad172f8.poster.avif?t=1759751628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/d0f96a0b9a00c16652515a693ad172f8.webm?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/d0f96a0b9a00c16652515a693ad172f8.mp4?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship's computer serves as the interface for every station. Offline stations only offer low-level file access, including configurations, logs, and data archives. Browse directories, read and download files; coordinates and research leads are often hidden in the details. Just keep in mind that every access is logged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/93c5957f3fd9119a4e959aa441cc46ef.poster.avif?t=1759751628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/93c5957f3fd9119a4e959aa441cc46ef.webm?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/93c5957f3fd9119a4e959aa441cc46ef.mp4?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2974010?t=1759751628","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2974010?t=1759751628","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/ef2c7cf4119a6e3ca88a192ff400b51076b1ed8c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759751628","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/ef2c7cf4119a6e3ca88a192ff400b51076b1ed8c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759751628","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FLY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an agile fly\u2011by\u2011wire spaceship in this <strong>single-player, first-person spaceflight simulator</strong>. Use the engine boost to fly at the limit, or save energy for the next wormhole jump. Collisions are costly; the polarized hull will protect the ship, but it will corrupt the memory core. <strong>You may lose your hard\u2011earned research data</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/924c82a24d8f66f1f1060cb21f08cb26.poster.avif?t=1759751628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/924c82a24d8f66f1f1060cb21f08cb26.webm?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/924c82a24d8f66f1f1060cb21f08cb26.mp4?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the ship scanner to detect anomalies. Fly in, <strong>run an analysis</strong>, and fill the memory core. Then, retrieve the data and leave before hull polarization becomes an issue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/ccf1b71a01e33ead072aac7b401d19d2.poster.avif?t=1759751628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati