m?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/d0f96a0b9a00c16652515a693ad172f8.mp4?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship's computer serves as the interface for every station. Offline stations only offer low-level file access, including configurations, logs, and data archives. Browse directories, read and download files; coordinates and research leads are often hidden in the details. Just keep in mind that every access is logged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/93c5957f3fd9119a4e959aa441cc46ef.poster.avif?t=1759751628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/93c5957f3fd9119a4e959aa441cc46ef.webm?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/93c5957f3fd9119a4e959aa441cc46ef.mp4?t=1759751628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["REDVERY e.K."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/header.jpg?t=1759751628","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Trailer Music: \"Strength of the Titans\" Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com) Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 License http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/<br />\r\n<br />\r\nREDVERY is a registered trademark of REDVERY e.K. \u00a9 2022 \u2013 2025.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubun